{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id253145385"}, "name":{"label":"HeathenBiker"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-28T10:01:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.1"}, "id":{"label":"14006429227"}, "title":{"label":"Great game but not on iOS"}, "content":{"label":"Updated review again: finally figured out how to exit the game from the title screen but it was not immediately apparent. Swiping up actually minimized the window and let me exit but it is very intermittent so I still have to reboot the phone some times to exit the app. \n\nStill doesn’t scale well on an iPhone 17 and the “notch” is in the way of dialog and toolbar buttons. Not ideal on iPhone at all and I ended up uninstalling and playing on a PC. Waste of $4.99 since apple refuses to refund me but oh well.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
