{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id25650844"}, "name":{"label":"Calamity Jen"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-26T14:57:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.1"}, "id":{"label":"14000409763"}, "title":{"label":"How is this allowed?"}, "content":{"label":"This game simply doesn’t work on an iPhone & I don’t understand how they’re allowed to take my money for it. I was so excited to grab this for my phone bc I love it on switch, but when I first opened it I noticed the toolbar, energy bar, etc bleed off the screen. After googling & finding this had been a complaint for years I was confused, but persisted. Using the options I was able to move the toolbar from being completely blocked by the black oblong where the selfie camera lives. Using the options I was able to get almost everything in screen, but the energy bar has no controls available & I can’t see the bottom… which is integral to gameplay wether you’re fishing, farming, or adventuring the mines. In every instance I need to know when I’m getting low & how low. Just super sad to see I was charged $5 for this despite seemingly EVERYONE knowing it doesn’t work on iPhone. Not cool.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
