{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1761001031"}, "name":{"label":"Browndogorgroundhog"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-23T17:29:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.1"}, "id":{"label":"13990247850"}, "title":{"label":"If you have the money, get it."}, "content":{"label":"Such an awesome game for people who love adventure, farming,\nand exploring. The characters are all well made for the story, they have fun quests to complete, interesting and mysterious storylines, which are great at getting you curious and addicted, it is like living the life of an ordinary farmer, except it has the excitement of pixelated and fake, but still interesting interactions with the love and hate you can get, the happiness and sadness, the gratefulness and jealousy, the nervousness and confidence. \nI’m not very great at explaining this game, because of how unique it is, but I think you should download, especially if you don’t usually have much to do after work or school, or on a weekend. It passes time pretty easily, but then once you have to stop playing so that you don’t forget your family members names, you won’t want to, so that’s the downside. There are no ads, optional or forced, just pure hard work and dedication required. After paying for the game, \nNo money is needed to progress, just dedication and addiction. \nIf you are going to get addicted to something, this is the thing. Thank you for reading! I hope I helped convince you to get addicted and in love with this adventurous game!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
