{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id40587655"}, "name":{"label":"Doobah badoo"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-08T19:20:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.1"}, "id":{"label":"13937777252"}, "title":{"label":"Disappointed"}, "content":{"label":"I have over 2400 hours in SDV on my PS5.  Obviously a game I enjoy… so I decided to give this a whirl… a tablet is a wee bit more portable.\n\nAnd on Day 2, while fishing, had the screen fully black out, forcing an exit and restart.\n\nI know the game to be a lot of fun.  I like the ability to water all 9 squares around the character., wish we had it on the PS5.  But to have it crash on Day Two, is severely disappointing.\n\nIt’s been deleted from my desktop, for now.  Whenever that bug is fixed, I’ll be happy to try it again.  But that bug makes it incredibly frustrating, especially given the importance of fishing in the game.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
